{"sha": "391239918a44513c3e65025c522f227cd98de3a2d6ef6e8ead18087096e1e2ae", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:multivar} 章 --- 二元函数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:1}", "$\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial x} = 2xy + y\\,\\eu^{xy}$,", "$\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial y} = x^2 + x\\,\\eu^{xy}$.", "", "$\\dfrac{\\partial g}{\\partial x} = \\dfrac{2x}{x^2+y^2}$,", "$\\dfrac{\\partial g}{\\partial y} = \\dfrac{2y}{x^2+y^2}$.", "", "$\\dfrac{\\partial h}{\\partial x} = \\dfrac{-y/x^2}{1 + y^2/x^2} =", "\\dfrac{-y}{x^2+y^2}$,", "$\\dfrac{\\partial h}{\\partial y} = \\dfrac{x}{x^2+y^2}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:2}", "在极坐标下（$\\rho \\to 0$）：", "", "$\\abs{f} = \\dfrac{\\rho^3\\abs{\\cos^2\\theta\\sin\\theta}}{\\rho^2} \\leq", "\\rho \\to 0$：连续。", "", "$g = \\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta$：与 $\\rho$ 无关，", "沿不同射线取不同值（参见\\", "\\cref{ex:b1:multivar:trap}）：极限不存在，不连续。", "", "$\\abs h \\leq \\dfrac{\\rho^3(\\abs{\\cos^3\\theta} +", "\\abs{\\sin^3\\theta})}{\\rho^2} \\leq 2\\rho \\to 0$：连续。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:3}", "沿 $y = mx$：$f(x, mx) = \\dfrac{m x^3}{x^4 + m^2 x^2} =", "\\dfrac{mx}{x^2 + m^2} \\to 0$（$m \\neq 0$；沿 $y = 0$ 与", "$y$ 轴时 $f = 0$）。故所有直线上的极限均为 $0$。但在", "抛物线 $y = x^2$ 上：", "\\[", "f(x, x^2) = \\frac{x^4}{x^4 + x^4} = \\frac12 :", "\\]", "点列 $\\bigl(\\frac1n, \\frac{1}{n^2}\\bigr) \\to (0,0)$ 使得", "$f \\to \\frac12 \\neq 0$。因此不连续：仅沿直线", "检验不足以判定二元函数的极限。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:4}", "$\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x} = 3x^2y^2 + y\\cos(xy)$；于是", "\\[", "\\frac{\\partial^2 f}{\\partial y\\,\\partial x}", "= 6x^2 y + \\cos(xy) - xy\\sin(xy) .", "\\]", "$\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y} = 2x^3 y + x\\cos(xy)$；于是", "\\[", "\\frac{\\partial^2 f}{\\partial x\\,\\partial y}", "= 6x^2 y + \\cos(xy) - xy\\sin(xy) :", "\\]", "二者相等，正如施瓦茨定理所保证的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:5}", "由\\cref{thm:b1:multivar:chain}，取 $(x, y) = (\\cos t, \\sin t)$：", "\\[", "g'(t) = -\\sin t\\,\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(\\cos t, \\sin t)", "+ \\cos t\\,\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}(\\cos t, \\sin t)", "= \\bigl\\langle \\nabla f,\\ (-\\sin t, \\cos t)\\bigr\\rangle .", "\\]", "在 $g$ 的极值点处 $g'(t) = 0$，故 $\\nabla f$ 与", "圆的切向量 $(-\\sin t, \\cos t)$ 正交，从而与", "半径向量 $(\\cos t, \\sin t)$ 平行（平面上，单位向量的", "正交补是其所张成的直线，取其垂直方向）。", "这是拉格朗日乘子法的", "最简单的实例。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:6}", "对 $f$：$\\nabla f = (2x + y - 3,\\; x + 2y) = 0$，得 $y = -\\frac x2$，且", "$2x - \\frac x2 = 3$，得 $x = 2$，$y = -1$。二阶：$r = 2$，$s =", "1$，$t = 2$：$rt - s^2 = 3 > 0$，$r > 0$：局部（事实上是整体的 ---", "因为是二次函数）极小值，在 $(2, -1)$ 处取值 $f(2,-1) = -3$。", "", "对 $g$：$\\nabla g = (2x,\\; -2y + 4) = 0$：临界点 $(0, 2)$；$r = 2$，$s", "= 0$，$t = -2$：$rt - s^2 = -4 < 0$：鞍点。", "", "对 $h$：$\\nabla h = \\bigl(4x^3 - 4(x - y),\\; 4y^3 + 4(x-y)\\bigr) = 0$。", "两式相加得 $x^3 + y^3 = 0$，故 $y = -x$；代入得 $4x^3 - 8x = 0$：", "$x \\in \\{0, \\pm\\sqrt2\\}$。临界点为 $(0,0)$，", "$(\\sqrt2, -\\sqrt2)$、$(-\\sqrt2, \\sqrt2)$。", "在 $(\\pm\\sqrt2, \\mp\\sqrt2)$ 处：$r = 12x^2 - 4 = 20$，$s = 4$，$t =", "20$，$rt - s^2 > 0$，$r > 0$：局部极小值（取值 $h = 4 + 4 - 16 =", "-8$）。在 $(0,0)$ 处：$r = t = -4$，$s = 4$：$rt - s^2 = 0$，无法判定。", "直接考察 $h(x, x) = 2x^4 > 0$ 与 $h(x, -x) = 2x^4 - 8x^2 < 0$，", "当 $x \\neq 0$ 充分小时，每个邻域内函数值正负皆有 ---", "故原点处无极值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:7}", "$x^2 - y^2$：其二阶偏导数分别为 $2$ 与 $-2$，和为 $0$。$xy$：两个纯", "二阶偏导数皆为零。$\\eu^x\\cos y$：$\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial", "x^2} = \\eu^x\\cos y$, $\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial y^2} =", "-\\eu^x\\cos y$：和为 $0$。$\\ln(x^2+y^2)$：由", "\\cref{exo:b1:multivar:1}，", "\\[", "\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial x^2}\\ln(x^2+y^2)", "= \\frac{2(x^2+y^2) - 4x^2}{(x^2+y^2)^2}", "= \\frac{2(y^2 - x^2)}{(x^2+y^2)^2},", "\\]", "而 $y$ 的情形与之相反，和为 $0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:multivar:8}", "\\emph{投影：}平面 $P$ 的法向量为 $n = (1, 2, -1)$，且", "过点 $A = (4, 0, 0)$。距原点最近的点是", "$O$ 的投影：$p = O + \\frac{\\langle A - O, n\\rangle}{\\norm", "n^2}\\,n = \\frac{4}{6}(1,2,-1) = \\bigl(\\frac23, \\frac43,", "-\\frac23\\bigr)$，距离为 $\\frac{4}{\\sqrt 6}$。（公式：", "原点到平面 $\\langle X, n \\rangle = c$ 的距离为", "$\\frac{\\abs c}{\\norm n}$，其中 $c = 4$。）", ""]}